# f1 = bare, f2 = other, L1 = Options. Only Object.defineProperty() gives "host" a value. Its slot is planned as read-only, not enumerable and not configurable, and the structure of L1 lists it that way.
# A store that finds the property absent creates a plain data property. A store that finds it present must check whether it is writable.
